english:
Match name by regex.
Examples:
^Chair_ matches names starting with Chair_;
_v\d+$ matches names ending with _v1/_v2 version tags;
(Lamp|Light) matches Lamp or Light

Match name by wildcard: * = any chars, ? = one char.
Examples:
Chair* matches names starting with Chair;
*_L* matches names containing _L;
Model_?.blend matches Model_A.blend etc
